So while you guys wait for that Q&amp;A to post you can click here to learn more about the Faceless Men of Braavos and the House of Black and White

00:08:50.974 --> 00:08:53.969
and you can click here for my episode one video from last week.

00:08:53.969 --> 00:08:56.914
Thank you so much for watching. Everybody lets high five. I'll see you guys tomorrow.

